 "note": "Lunenburg High School: the page prints no school name, but it continues the 'LUNENBURG HIGH SCHOOL FACULTY' list begun on page 65 in the same 'Department - names' layout, with high-school departments (Foreign Language, Guidance for Grades 9-12, Director of Athletics). The department is grade_or_dept; a title printed with one person (Librarian, Grades 9 & 11, R.N., Head Custodian) is role_raw. Line 16 'Horticulture Aide' is a role wrapped from the line above, read as Linda Sacksen's (the last name on line 15) and recorded in her role_raw; the line itself is ignored since it names no one. Line 6's 'I' is a scanned dash. Richard Stachowicz is printed twice (Physical Education and Director of Athletics) and Sue Catanese is also the Passios nurse on page 60; both printings kept. Line 23 is the page number."
